1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/ARZTTIPEHNP7JMC264T2WUHQTU.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/WVALC5ZNABHGNB4D5WXZXREHWY/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Samsung Bio's all-out strike continues... Labor-management parallel, only losses snowball&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/WVALC5ZNABHGNB4D5WXZXREHWY/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;삼성바이오 전면파업 지속... 노사 평행선, 손실만 눈덩이&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GJSWGY3CGQ3DEZTGGU2TAMRQHA.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/MM4GMMZWGEZGCOJQMI4TENDEGA/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;靑 "We will respond to the US 'EU car tariff increase' by analyzing the impact"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/MM4GMMZWGEZGCOJQMI4TENDEGA/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;靑, 美 ‘EU 車관세 인상’에 “영향 분석해 대응할 것”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/MM4DKNRXMZQTCZJYGNTDOMBYGI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/MUYTMN3BMRRTMMLCMI2DSOJQGI/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Minister of Culture, Sports and Tourism Choi Hwi-young: "We have not considered relocating Hanyejong to the province at all"&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/MUYTMN3BMRRTMMLCMI2DSOJQGI/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;최휘영 문체부 장관 “한예종 지방 이전, 전혀 검토한 바 없다”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GAYDCZTGMZRDOOLCGM4GKNDFMI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/MEZTINLDGY2WCZBVMMYWMMRUMU/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Until Yanghyangja, the June 3 provincial governor bracket is completed... With water change, undefeated in the field&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/MEZTINLDGY2WCZBVMMYWMMRUMU/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;양향자까지, 6·3 시도지사 대진표 완성… 與 물갈이, 野 현역 불패&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/GNSTKYRRHBRWGNBZMNSDAMBVGA.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/HA3GGNDEGQ4TAODCMEZWIZJYGA/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Controversy over Jeong Jung-oh's poll promotional materials... Posted and deleted without investigation agency or period&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/HA3GGNDEGQ4TAODCMEZWIZJYGA/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;[단독] 정원오 여론조사 홍보물 또 논란…조사 기관·기간 없이 올렸다 삭제&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/MMZDMNZYHBRTAYZUHE4GIMTGMI.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2026/05/02/G5SDCNLFGYYGMODEGVQTONJUGU/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Next-generation medium-sized satellite No. 2 launched from Vandenberg, USA on the 3rd... Mounted on the Falcon 9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/science/2026/05/02/G5SDCNLFGYYGMODEGVQTONJUGU/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;차세대중형위성 2호, 3일 美 반덴버그서 발사… 팰컨9에 탑재&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://cloudfront-ap-northeast-1.images.arcpublishing.com/chosun/HBQWKM3DMZTDONBYMNSTIYJVG4.jpg" width="60" alt="thumb"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/XOV2CDGVKJFWJCUTVXNVRXRZQY/" style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Yang Hyang-ja for the People's Power Gyeonggi Governor's Candidate... Confrontation with Chu Mi-ae&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.chosun.com/economy/economy_general/2026/05/02/XOV2CDGVKJFWJCUTVXNVRXRZQY/" style="font-size: 1.4em;"&gt;국민의힘 경기지사 후보에 양향자… 추미애와 맞대결&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;]]&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">economy-update-2026-05-03T10:45:01.530090+09:00</guid><pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 10:45:01 +0900</pubDate></item></channel></rss>